Basic SQL — Questions with Answers
Q1. Display all customers.
SELECT *
FROM customers;
Q2. Display customer name and email.
SELECT customer_name, email
FROM customers;
Q3. Find customers from Pune.
SELECT *
FROM customers
WHERE city = 'Pune';
Q4. Find products costing more than ₹10,000.
SELECT *
FROM products
WHERE price > 10000;
Q5. Find products with stock less than 30.
SELECT *
FROM products
WHERE stock < 30;
Q6. Display all Electronics products.
SELECT *
FROM products
WHERE category = 'Electronics';
Q7. Find customers who signed up after March 1, 2024.
SELECT *
FROM customers
WHERE signup_date > '2024-03-01';
Q8. Find all delivered orders.
SELECT *
FROM orders
WHERE order_status = 'Delivered';
Q9. Find orders greater than ₹20,000.
SELECT *
FROM orders
WHERE total_amount > 20000;
Q10. Display Sales employees.
SELECT *
FROM employees
WHERE department = 'Sales';
